<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Tue Mar 03 2020 16:27:33 GMT+0200 (SAST) tc</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruth laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rut.</para>
  <para style="mt">Ruth</para>
  <para style="mt">Ruth laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide ga raupwa kela mina kenlangbe zi teu eh raulu. Cide David hegwangpei tingdau raukelu nzwa, pe kiria pedum kekam lebie ngau kelu ndaa pe pau Boaz, Ruth de pe nau kelube pei de.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ruth au Israelme kelak ge Canaan ga herakum dau Moab gage tetgai kedi ha raugai. Pe nahpei nah pe napei kena tsaidi, pe pui Naomi de püt zeu di eh pe na nau kenade Orpah nah Ruth de si eh. Naomi au Israel ga cailigwang di kera cetlu nah Ruth de pecu ngngwa cailigwang kera neubi di. Israel ga cailigwang luge, penai kibaume pei Boaz dade kengha kie Ruth kekamle Boaz naudi. Penui kelak gade hegwangpei David nah Messiah, Jisu Khrista gwanglu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide keku nah kelungsang ha ledeu sütgai. Cide Tinggwang au anui tingba ramsang teu maikesia lungnei kebam nah pa au anuide kelikelu ciem riem kebam ledeu beu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Naomi Israel gade tetkedi nah cailikegwang (1:1-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ruth de ngngwa kelu (2:1-3:18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Boaz nah Ruth (4:1-22)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Elimelek Moab ga pe kelak de ngngwa kepet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Israelme deu ga tutiakme kedi tei kebam tingdau herakum gwangdi. Bethlehem ga lungh kebam Judahme pei ge, pa nah pe nau nah pe napei kena de ngngwa Moab deudi ga kak ge lungh kera miedi. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Nah cipau pei de zi Elimelek, nah pe nau zi cai Naomi, nah pe napei kena zi be Mahlon penai Kilion. Penui pelane Ephrathme Bethlehem ga kelungh Judahme. Cine penui Moab deudi ga tetmie delwe cika lunghdi.<verse eid="RUT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Ge Naomi nahpei Elimelek, tsaidi. Nah Noami pena kena de rünne ngngwa bamdi. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Nah penai Moabme relei de penai naulu; keraibe pui zi cai Orpah, nah pe kenabe pui zi cai Ruth. Nah penui cika mmi kerei kenzwa ge lunghdi. <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Nah Mahlon penai Kilion hangnana de tsaidi, nah Naomi pena kena mede pe nahpei si mene pecu rünne banglu.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naomi penai Ruth cailikegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Pecai Naomi Moab deudi gade RAMPAUBE pe minadung de Judah ga ketyeipok keyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ketyeipok keyi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: luhlüt keyi.</char></note> pwa kepeu ha siulu. Cine Naomi nah pe na nau kena Moab deu gade pe nam ga cailigwang kera mteilu. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Cine pa lungh kebam heni gade pe na nau kena de nzang lwe tet mpetdi, nah penui Judahme deu ga cailigwang kerane lampui ga tet nghung.<verse eid="RUT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Pecai Naomi pe napei nau kena dade rangdi, “Tetcu, cailigwang nnai pui kiga gwang daidi lulo. Peu RAMPAUBE de nnai dade pezai yi kelube tei lulo, nnai tsaikedime dade nah a dade keyi nzwa. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Peu RAMPAUBE de nnai de meu dailu kebui nah nnai ki ngau dailu kera samlam beulo.” Pecai pa penaide kemamgai, nah penai hap cuhdi.<verse eid="RUT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />Dede penai pe dage rangdi, “Lak, anai ncu ngngwa n leuhme da cailigwang zie.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Dede Naomi rangdi, “Caili lulo, a napui kena! Daitei nnai acu ngngwa tet laino? Ih nnai ziemne nnai nahpei tei kera mna dailu buini? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Caili gwang cu, a napui kena, tetcu! Kedanemene Ih au a nahpei tei dai kera hecing süt dida. Ih a keregui bam reu de rang cai, nah Ih heziu a nahpei bam liecai, nah Ih mipeina de mna lu bui liede, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />nnai penui ngkieng cuh kemaktane kwa bam lubui ni? Aide ziemne nnai meu dai mene kwa bam zie deni? Ma, a napui kena! Nnai swade Ih a lung sia gwa dida, kedanemene RAMPAUBE acu ngkau kedine.”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Pecai penai hap cuh daidi. Ge Orpah pa penai de yila lulo kemam gai eh kilung ga caili gwangdi, dede Ruth pecu ngngwa bamdi.<verse eid="RUT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Pecai pa rangdi, “Pielo, n heipei nau pe mina nah pe rabedung da cailigwang dida. N heipei nau caisui eh n kilung cailigwang culo.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Dede Ruth keligai, “Acu peu ncu pütdi kera mede n caisui kelade gade nreu tetdi kera rang helo. Kedanemene nang kemie ga Ih mie zie, nah nang kebam ga Ih bam zie. N minadung de a mina zie, nah n Tinggwang de a Tinggwang zie. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Nang ketsai gade Ih tsai zie, nah cika ge acu kung zie. Ketsai de gwale magade keheibe ne acu peu n dade keuntsam dicai, peu RAMPAUBE de saja siasüt eh acu peu lulo.”<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Pecai Ruth pecu ngngwa tetbi kera pe lungning kedi ngau luge, Naomi pe dage magede rangsi tadi.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Cine penai Bethlehem nam ga gwang canglu kemaktane nbeuh jüja gwang. Nah cinzwa eh, penai Bethlelem ga gwang canglu herizi, namceu ga kebam pelane penai ziemne penui suiyi sütdi. Nah mipuidung rangdi, “Aide Naomi deni?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Dede pa penui dage rangdi, “Acu Naomi lie qu so, acu Mara lie qulu, kedanemene Ngkiengtube Tinggwang acu tei kehereisüt gailu. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Ih au mahei eh tet mpet, dede made teu mene RAMPAUBE acu ngngwa cailigwang daibeu. RAMPAUBE acu tei keherei gai, nah Ngkiengtube Tinggwang a dage keherei langgai, daitei nnui acu Naomi lie qu laino?”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Iciu eh Naomi pe napei nau, Moabme pui Ruth de ngngwalwe Moab deu gade caili gwanglu. Nah penai barley luhlüt kerai tingdau Bethlehem ga gwang canglu.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ruth Boaz luh ga heta ketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Naomi pe nahpei kibaume ge, Elimelek peiname gade pe zi Boaz<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fq" closed="false">Pe nahpei kibaume </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mede </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pe nahpei kangngwame </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Hebrew Ketiv)</char></note> lie kecu kemlang hangkia pei ge Bethlehem nam ga bamla.<verse eid="RUT 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Tingnai ge Ruth, Moabme pui Naomi dage rangdi, “Acu peu luh ga mielo delwe a dade pe zai yi eh pe luh ga mei gikedidung de peu pa kera kepeu de hekwa lu kerane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:2">Nah Naomi pe dage keligai, “A napoi, miecu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Cine pa luhgwetme cai hekwa kera miedi. Nah cinzwa eh pa Elimelek peiname Boaz lie kecube luh ga gwanglu.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Pecai matie mene Boaz Bethlehem gade gwanglwe luhgwetme de kelumgai, “Peu RAMPAUBE de nnuide ngngwala lulo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Nah penui pe dage rangdi, “Peu RAMPAUBE de ncu samlam kebeube teilo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Pecai Boaz pe kilabe, luhgwetme reu teu kelabe dade rangdi, “Aipau releipui de cau no?”<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Pecai kilabe luhgwetme reu teu kelabe keligai, “Pa au Naomi de ngngwa Moabme deu gade caili kegwang Moabme releipui delie. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Pa rangdi, ‘Kehereide luhgwetme cai meikwa rum pwa kebam gade acu peu pa nah hekwalo.’ Nah pa tingcang de gwang cu kecang mtak mezing eh msui pwala. Pa cune kak nage ki ga mtak bam.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Iciu eh Boaz Ruth dade rangdi, “A sam kingnei lu, a napoi. Kedame luh gade mie pa so, aika anui taiga bam eh pa lu. A luh ga heta tei kela relei puidung taiga lalu. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Penui rum kela ga pielwe penui caisui lu. Ih rehangmedung de ncu tung lak lie rangbeu dida. Nang hereu kecu dau, rehangme duitwak pwa kebam de ga mielwe saklu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Pecai Ruth pe zu keumie hangdeu tung eh pe dage rangdi, “Ih ngaungia cikenzwa ngaulu kera dai teipwa bam no? Ih au sangme ge gwale ma.”<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Iciu eh Boaz keligai eh pe dage rangdi, “N nahpei tsai kedi cai nang n nai dage tei kegai pelane a dage nha ranglia pwa bam. Nang n pei nah n pui nah ncu kemna deu pütdi eh nang pedwa ci mezing kecu minadung kakga gwang lungh bam. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Nang tei kegai de ziemne peu RAMPAUBE de n ziehi tei beulo, nah RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, nang pe hesiu kangga gwang msiu kebambe de peu n ziehi teicang siak kebeube teilo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Pecai Ruth rangdi, “A kedibo, nang au a dade n zai yizu lie, kedanemene nang sam keyi teu a lung tei nciepgai, Ih au n kilapui mege de melie de.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Matyei kera ting dige, Boaz Ruth dage rangdi, “Aika gwang, tangku tyeilu nah ngu tangku kehiadui gage mpung lulo.” Cine pa luhgwetme taiga gwang ntumlu, nah pa tangku rukelube kesa pwa pecu peu. Nah pa tyei nggei lu kemaktane tyeilu, nah pa kesa tyei banglu. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Pa meibui mie pa dai kera tetdi ge. Boaz rehangmedung dage aja kaigai, “Peu pecu meikwa kang kenzeu gade de palu, nah pecu tei ngngam diso. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Cirüne mene, meikwa kang kenzeu gade meibui kesa peu pecu pa kera ziemne zang gai beulu, nah pecu herata so.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Cine pa tinghegi kecang luh gade meibui pa hekwalu. Pecai pa keludung dap mpetlu ge, cide barley ephah ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ephah ge </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilogram kereiekena.</char></note> kenzwa ge ngaulu. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Nah pa cide punglwe namdi ga gwanglu, nah penai pa hekwalu keludung de ngaulu. Nah pa matyei nggei kelucai bang kelude pecu pwapeu.<verse eid="RUT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Ge penai dage rangdi, “Dai gade nang henai mie pa no, nah nang dai gade mata tei no? Ncu ngaungia kebeube depeu samlam pung kelube teilo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Ge pa penai dage mige pe zi Boaz lie kecube de luh gade mata teilie ranglia.<verse eid="RUT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Ge Naomi pe napei nau dade rangdi, “Peu RAMPAUBE keringme nah ketsaime dade pe samkakkelu kesamsang de madaude gahdi la kemakbe de peu pecu samlam beulo.” Nah Naomi pe dage rangsi, “Cipau pei de au anui kibaume kemname gelie. Pa au anui kibaume ma pie kera pe zie kecume hangge da.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Pecai Moabme pui Ruth rangdi, “Pa a dage ranggai si gai, ‘Nang a kilame taiga bamlu penui agu meidung pelane luhlüt cangkelu kemaktane.’”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Pecai Naomi pe napei nau Ruth dage rangdi, “A napoi, pe kilame releidung de ngngwa mata tei cai n ziemne yiki zie, nang mi kedame luh ga miecai ncu hengam teidi lubui.”<verse eid="RUT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Cine barley luhlüt nah wheat luhlüt canglu kemaktane pa Boaz ta ketei releime taiga de mei pa hekwa kecu teilu. Nah pa penai de ngngwa lungh bamdi.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Ruth hecaipung ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Tingnaige penai Naomi pe dage rangdi, “A napoi n ziemne yilu kerane Ih n nahpei peei beu maisia da. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Nang pe releimedung de nzang mata tei kebam mpaube, Boaz aide anui kibaume meni? Ainie, pa heziu hecaipung gade barley tei mci bam zie. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Cu nang duipia lu, periem kehengui keniaklu, nah nnia keyibe teulu, delwe hecaipung ga hung culo. Pa matyei masak canglu kemakta nang cika bamlie kecu peu ciso. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Nah pa zeu kecudau, nang pa daiga zeu zeubi ci siaktelu. Pecai mie pe pi gum pwa kebam de gaudi delwe pe pi ga zeulu. Iciude pa ncu tei kerabe ranglia zie.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Ruth pe dage keligai, “Nang kerang pelane, Ih tei luzie.”<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Cine pa hecaipung ga mielu delwe penai rangkebeu de kesiak ge teilu. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Boaz matyei nah saklwe pe suiyi bam, nah pa mei hekwa pwa kebam tu ga gwang zeudi. Pecai Ruth sünne eh pe taiga lütlu, nah pe pi gum pwa kebam de gaulwe pe pi ga zeudi. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Pecai tingmui muisumge mipeibe mrak lop de gwang nah zeudet gwang ge, ainie, mipui ge pe pi ga zeu kebam ngaulu!<verse eid="RUT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Nah pa keteudi, “Nang cauno?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Pecai pa rangdi, “Ih au n kilabe pui Ruth lie. Nang n pai tuna gele n kilapui de hagai beulo, kedanemene nang au anui kibaume ma pie kebeube lu.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Pecai pa rangdi, “A napoi, RAMPAUBE de peu ncu samlam beulo! Nang n samkakkelu kesamsang de kerai dau swade kekamle kai mting kilu delie, rehangme keheime mede kegahme de nang peiswa kemakne. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Cine cu, a napoi, ngngi diso! Nang kerang leune Ih n ziemne teibeu zie ; kedanemene renam ga a minadung pelane nang mipui keyi ge lie kecu ci bamlu. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Ih au anui kibaume ma pie kera a zie kesangda, dede a swade nna ki kecu mige bamreu. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Heziu aika bamlu. Nah ncünne tingcang dide, magade pa ncu nma pie beuzie liecai, makeyi da, peu pecu nma pielu. Dede pa nma pie daulak liecai, Ih ringkela RAMPAUBE zi teu nma pielu kera sampet gaila. Tingcang kemaktane zeu bamlu.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Cine Ruth tingcang kemakta pe pi ga zeu bamdi, dede pa mi pecu ngau kera tingbaa mmi kemakne cuhlwe tetdi. Nah Boaz rangdi, “Peu migede de mipuibe hecaipung ga gwang lie kecu ciso.”<verse eid="RUT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Pecai Boaz pe dage rangdi, “Nang teukebam pai de lwak mpetlwe kam gailo.” Cine pa pe pai kamlu. Ge pa barley mdet herok<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Barley mdet herok </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilogram ngkaiemdai.</char></note> ge mdetlwe pe pai gage ruigai beu. Pecai pa namdi ga caili gwangdi.<verse eid="RUT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Ruth penai taiga gwang luge Naomi keteu eh, “Dainzwa ah a napoi?” Pecai mipeibe pe dage teikegai leune pa pau beu.<verse eid="RUT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Pa rang si eh, “Pa acu barley herok ge mdet beu, kedanemene pa rangdi, ‘Nang n nai taiga mta gwang daulak.’”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Pecai Naomi rangdi, “N lung teilu, a napoi, aipau ha de dainzwa tei gwang ziebi kecu kwa eh. Kedanemene mina aipaude henai aipau ha de tei canglu kemaktane mtak laklu.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Boaz Ruth de penau kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Cipaucai Boaz namdi rieki ga nghang cika ntumlu. Nah ainie, penui kibaume ma kepiebe pei de tetkah gwangla, pedwa Boaz pe ha rang kebam pei de. Nah pa rangdi, “Aika gwang ntum lulo.” Cine pa nreu cailigwang ntumlu. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Pecai pa renam ga hangkiame mina hangkerei de qulu delwe rangdi, “Aika ntum lulo.” Cine penui ntum bamlu.<verse eid="RUT 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Pecai Boaz pe kibaume pei dage rangdi, “Naomi, Moabme deu gade cailigwang dai kebambe pui de, anui sinabe pei Elimelek luh kesa zwadi neu bamlie. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Cine Ih cide ha ncu ranglia kera cetlu, iciu eh nang cide luulu neu liulu kerane. Nang cipau deude luu neucai hangkiamedung kebam gade liulu. Dede nang luu neu mecai, cu gage acu rangbeu lo, kedanemene cide liu kera Ih n cia kerabe delu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Pecai minabe rangdi, “Ih cide luilu zie.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fq" closed="false">Nang magade lui lak lie cai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Meliede </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Magade pa lui lakcai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Hebrew laisiudung ketsam ga) </char></note> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fq" closed="false">Iciu de Ih ci luzie </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mede </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nah peu acu cilo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Hebrew Qere) </char></note><verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Pecai Boaz rangdi, “Nang cipau luh de Naomi ba gade lui kelu benai Moabme pui Ruth pe nahpei tsai kedibe puide de gum jüja zie, ciciu eh pe mabam gum kelu gade tsai kedime zi peu lalu kerane.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Ge pe kibaume pei rangdi, “Ih au lui daulak kedanemene a name cipau luh de gum laklu. A qwade nang lui lulo, kedanemene Ih au luu daulak delu.” <verse eid="RUT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Ndaa Israelme ting ga ainzwa makie keheibe de teimci lula, maabam lui mede rehiak kecu gade zwa kebeube pe picum lwaklwe pe zangbe de peu dila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keda ga nzwa, Israel gade picum de kengkieng kebam zasi lie la, nah picum lwak mpet kegai au kengkieng nah mi nzeu pwa peudi kecu rehi ge. </char></note> Iciu eh Israelme ainzwa samcak tei lula. <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Cine pe kibaume pei Boaz dade rangdi, “Nang cide luilu,” nah pa pe picum lwakdi.<verse eid="RUT 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Pecai Boaz hangkiamedung nah mina pelane dage rangdi, “Ih henai Elimelek gu ma pelane nah Kilion penai Mahlon gu ma pelane Naomi ba gade luilu delie de kecu nnui a zierangme delie. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Nah tsai kedibe Mahlon nau Moabme pui Ruth de Ih a nau dizie da. iciu eh tsai kedibe zi pe mabam reu bamlu zie, nah tsai kedibe zi peu pe sinamedung kak gade nah pe nam gade gahdi melu kerane. Henai nnui a zierangme delie.”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Nah herieki ga mina kebamme pelane nah hangkiamedung rangdi, “Anui n zierangme delie. Peu RAMPAUBE de n ki ga gwang lai eh kebambe puide, peu Rachel penai Leah, Israel leuhme de teimdi kebeu nzwa lulo. Ephrathah ga herüt pung kelube teilo, nah Bethlehem ga ndu kelube teilo! <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Peu RAMPAUBE de mipui kehena aipau puide dade ncu hena pwa kepeudung de peu, Tamar penai Judah napei Perez ki kelak nzwa kelube teilo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:3">Mat. 1:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boaz tsame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Cine Boaz Ruth de luu pwa penau lu, nah pa pecu ngngwa nauhepei zai teidi. Pecai RAMPAUBE pecu peu tetlaklu, nah pa mipeina ge mnalu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:4">Mat. 1:4</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 1:5">5</ref></char></note><verse eid="RUT 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Pecai Bethlehemme mipuidung Naomi dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE zi peu ndu lulo, pa henai n kibaume ma pie kerabe de ncu peuda. Peu pe zi Israel ga mlang kelube tei lulo! <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Cu pa n teilung tei heci daibeu zie nah nang cing kedi caide ncu ngkwet beuzie. Kedanemene pa au n napei nau, ncu hung kelabe pui nah n napei hang hena swade yiki kecube pui napei lu.”<verse eid="RUT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Naomi ngiena de pwalu eh pe niepum gage kailu, nah pa pe ngkwetpui teidi. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Cine kidame puidung ranggai, “Naomi mipeina ge de mna luda.” Nah penui pe zi Obed msiaklu. Obed au David pei, Jesse pei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:6">Mat. 1:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Aide Perez paupak ha, Perez be Hezron pei; <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />nah Hezron be Ram pei; Ram be Amminadab pei; <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />nah Amminadab be Nahshon pei; Nahshon be Salmon pei; <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salmon be Boaz pei; Boaz be Obed pei; <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obed be Jesse pei; nah Jesse be David pei.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>